expression: "format_str(indoc!\n{\n    r#\"\n        # for some weird reason this is only parsed correctly if in a parentheses\n        (\n            # before\n            if # if\n            # 1\n            ( # open\n                # 2\n                a && b # condition\n                # 3\n            ) # close\n            # 4\n            {\n                y\n            }\n            # 5\n            else # else\n            # 6\n            {\n                4\n            }\n            # after\n        )\n    \"#\n}).unwrap()"
